  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal, multiprofile models with transformer aggregation and weighted fusion (e.g., config_048) achieve high performance. This experiment tests whether replacing the RNA encoder (scvi_n200 → pca_n2000) while keeping other components (resnet50 image encoder, transformer aggregation, weighted fusion) constant clarifies the impact of RNA representation choices. It isolates the effect of the RNA encoder, a key design decision, and extends the successful configuration of config_048 with minimal changes."
